WEBVTT

00:00:00.597 --> 00:00:01.470
Hello everyone.

00:00:01.781 --> 00:00:05.710
In this lesson, we do a lash lift and tint, step by step.

00:00:06.034 --> 00:00:08.430
Throughout the service, remember three things:

00:00:08.745 --> 00:00:10.457
the client's eyes stay closed,

00:00:10.407 --> 00:00:13.505
the lotion never touches the skin or gets into the eye,

00:00:13.455 --> 00:00:16.830
and the timing always follows the instructions of the brand.

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:18.193
Step one:

00:00:18.362 --> 00:00:20.593
consultation, and the allergy test.

00:00:20.929 --> 00:00:25.313
Ask about her eyes, about allergies, and about her last lash lift.

00:00:25.777 --> 00:00:28.993
See the lesson on when not to do a service if anything is worrying.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.126
If the client has extensions, remove them first,

00:00:32.076 --> 00:00:34.113
as in the refills and removal lesson.

00:00:34.705 --> 00:00:36.273
Look at the natural lashes:

00:00:36.313 --> 00:00:40.593
long or short, fine or thick, to choose the shield and the timing.

00:00:40.765 --> 00:00:44.329
If you will tint, do an allergy test as the brand instructs,

00:00:44.279 --> 00:00:46.673
usually 48 hours before the appointment.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:49.953
Write the test date and the result in the client's profile.

00:00:50.619 --> 00:00:51.400
Step two:

00:00:51.808 --> 00:00:54.200
cleanse the lashes with an oil free cleanser.

00:00:54.615 --> 00:00:58.360
Leftover mascara or oil makes the lotion absorb unevenly.

00:00:58.709 --> 00:01:00.200
Dry the lashes thoroughly.

00:01:00.621 --> 00:01:03.793
If the lashes are still wet, the adhesive will not hold,

00:01:03.743 --> 00:01:05.800
and the lashes slide off the shield,

00:01:05.909 --> 00:01:07.880
so wait until they are completely dry.

00:01:08.194 --> 00:01:09.000
Step three:

00:01:09.236 --> 00:01:12.578
have the client lie down comfortably with her eyes closed,

00:01:12.528 --> 00:01:16.040
then place the under eye pads, covering all the lower lashes.

00:01:16.548 --> 00:01:19.599
The pads keep the lower lashes from getting onto the shield,

00:01:19.549 --> 00:01:22.200
and protect the skin under the eyes from the lotion.

00:01:22.533 --> 00:01:24.680
Place them flat, without touching the eye.

00:01:25.341 --> 00:01:26.123
Step four:

00:01:26.379 --> 00:01:27.323
choose the shield.

00:01:27.585 --> 00:01:29.483
Short lashes, small shield.

00:01:29.766 --> 00:01:31.883
Long lashes, a larger shield.

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:34.283
For more curl, go a little smaller.

00:01:34.552 --> 00:01:36.523
For a gentler curl, go larger.

00:01:36.952 --> 00:01:39.083
Before sticking it on, test the fit:

00:01:39.439 --> 00:01:43.083
gently brush the lashes onto the shield and see where the tips reach.

00:01:43.512 --> 00:01:47.803
Many brands say the tips should sit from about the middle to near the top edge of the shield,

00:01:47.912 --> 00:01:49.243
depending on the curl you want.

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:51.243
Follow the chart of your own brand.

00:01:51.496 --> 00:01:55.488
Stick the shield on the upper lid, as close to the lash line as possible,

00:01:55.438 --> 00:01:57.163
following the curve of the eye,

00:01:57.278 --> 00:01:59.243
from the inner corner to the outer corner.

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:02.923
The shield sits only on the eyelid skin, never touching the eye.

00:02:03.188 --> 00:02:06.683
If the shield is away from the lash line, the lashes will get a kink.

00:02:07.354 --> 00:02:08.214
Step five:

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:09.974
lashes onto the shield.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:14.134
Spread a very thin layer of lash lift adhesive on the shield.

00:02:14.484 --> 00:02:16.748
Then, with a lash separating tool,

00:02:16.698 --> 00:02:20.134
brush the lashes up onto the shield in small groups.

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:22.774
Work from the inner corner to the outer corner.

00:02:22.965 --> 00:02:24.454
Watch the lower lashes:

00:02:24.641 --> 00:02:26.374
none of them may get onto the shield.

00:02:26.466 --> 00:02:29.726
Every lash must lie straight, separated, not crossing,

00:02:29.676 --> 00:02:33.174
with the root standing up close to the edge of the shield.

00:02:33.683 --> 00:02:37.174
A lash lying crooked now will be curled crooked afterwards.

00:02:37.575 --> 00:02:40.053
This step is the one most worth doing slowly.

00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:41.578
Step six:

00:02:41.835 --> 00:02:44.058
the first lotion, the softening lotion.

00:02:44.637 --> 00:02:49.042
With a small cotton swab, apply a thin layer to the lower part of the lashes,

00:02:48.992 --> 00:02:51.418
from near the root up to about the middle.

00:02:51.676 --> 00:02:53.098
Never on the eyelid skin.

00:02:53.447 --> 00:02:57.178
And not out to the tips, because the tips are fine and easily damaged.

00:02:57.707 --> 00:03:02.216
Cover the shield with a thin piece of cling film, to keep in warmth and moisture.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:06.696
Then set the timer, by the chart of the brand and the client's lash type.

00:03:07.191 --> 00:03:09.256
Never leave it on longer just to be sure.

00:03:09.762 --> 00:03:12.696
Too long means frizzy, brittle lashes.

00:03:13.177 --> 00:03:16.968
While you wait, ask the client whether she feels any stinging,

00:03:16.918 --> 00:03:18.296
burning or discomfort.

00:03:18.639 --> 00:03:23.576
If she does, wipe the lotion off at once, rinse with clean water, and stop.

00:03:24.181 --> 00:03:24.950
Step seven:

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:26.230
remove the lotion.

00:03:26.487 --> 00:03:31.430
With a dry cotton swab, wipe gently from root to tip, until all the lotion is gone.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.910
The lashes must stay still on the shield.

00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:35.190
Step eight:

00:03:35.614 --> 00:03:37.670
the second lotion, the setting lotion.

00:03:38.019 --> 00:03:41.602
Apply it to the same area as the first lotion, cover with film,

00:03:41.552 --> 00:03:43.510
time it by the chart of the brand,

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.030
then wipe it off as before.

00:03:45.682 --> 00:03:46.562
Step nine:

00:03:46.738 --> 00:03:49.282
tint, only if the allergy test was clear.

00:03:49.689 --> 00:03:52.562
Choose the shade by the client's brow and hair color.

00:03:52.923 --> 00:03:56.802
Mix the tint in the exact ratio on the label, just before use.

00:03:57.231 --> 00:04:01.922
Apply it to the lashes lying on the shield, only on the lashes, never on the skin.

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:03.442
Time it by the brand.

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:06.529
Then wipe it off thoroughly with a damp cotton pad,

00:04:06.479 --> 00:04:08.322
until the cotton comes away clean.

00:04:08.642 --> 00:04:11.842
Tint left behind can stain the skin and cause irritation.

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:13.370
Step ten:

00:04:13.696 --> 00:04:15.450
release the lashes from the shield.

00:04:15.845 --> 00:04:20.359
Put a little water on a cotton swab, or use the remover that comes with the kit,

00:04:20.309 --> 00:04:22.090
and gently lift the lashes off.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.770
Never pull or tug.

00:04:24.103 --> 00:04:26.410
Remove the shield, then clean the eyelid.

00:04:26.844 --> 00:04:31.130
If the kit includes a lash serum, brush a thin layer onto the lashes.

00:04:31.389 --> 00:04:32.730
Then compare both eyes:

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:34.810
are the curl and the color even?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:38.897
Remove the pads, then let the client open her eyes slowly.

00:04:39.398 --> 00:04:43.791
If her eyes sting or water, let her close them, rinse with clean water,

00:04:43.741 --> 00:04:45.137
and keep an eye on it.

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:46.657
Aftercare:

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:51.137
keep the lashes dry for as long as the brand advises, usually one day.

00:04:51.566 --> 00:04:55.457
During that time, no mascara, no steam, no rubbing.

00:04:55.966 --> 00:04:58.497
The result usually lasts about six to eight weeks.

00:04:58.847 --> 00:05:01.377
Never lift again sooner than the brand advises.

00:05:01.541 --> 00:05:04.497
Book the next visit when plenty of new lashes have grown in.

00:05:05.162 --> 00:05:06.658
A habit well worth keeping:

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:11.549
write in the client's profile the shield size you used, the timing for each lotion,

00:05:11.499 --> 00:05:12.578
and the tint shade.

00:05:12.991 --> 00:05:16.898
Next time, if the result was beautiful, do exactly the same again.

00:05:17.326 --> 00:05:20.498
If it was not quite right, you know exactly what to adjust.

00:05:20.886 --> 00:05:22.258
Once the client has gone:

00:05:22.527 --> 00:05:28.738
cotton swabs, pads, film, and any leftover mixed product go in the bin, never saved.

00:05:29.025 --> 00:05:32.438
Shields and reusable tools are cleaned and disinfected,

00:05:32.388 --> 00:05:34.578
as in the lesson on handling tools.

00:05:34.923 --> 00:05:37.618
And now, take the short quiz below the video.
